      "I'm deeply invested in AI agents and agentic workflows, actively building with and evaluating frontier models (Claude, Gemini, GPT, Llama) based on task-specific efficiency to automate research, reporting, and optimization pipelines. My passion is blending technical rigor with creative storytelling to unlock growth — and using AI agents to do it faster, smarter, and at scale.": "我深耕 AI 智能体与агент式工作流，持续使用并评估前沿模型（Claude、Gemini、GPT、Llama），依据具体任务的效率来自动化调研、报告与优化流程。我热衷于将技术严谨与创意叙事结合，以释放增长，并借助 AI 智能体更快、更聪明、更大规模地实现它。",
      "Throughout my career at companies like EmblemHealth, Google, Adtaxi, and C-4 Analytics, I've bridged technical analytics engineering with high-level executive decision making. Whether auditing multi-touch attribution models, running CRO sprints, or building localized on-premise AI agents, my focus remains squarely on bottom-line multiplier return.": "在 EmblemHealth、Google、Adtaxi 和 C-4 Analytics 等公司的职业生涯中，我始终在技术分析工程与高层决策之间搭建桥梁。无论是审计多触点归因模型、推进 CRO 冲刺，还是构建本地部署的 AI 智能体，我的关注点始终是放大最终的业务回报。",
      "Hi, I'm Youssef McCarthy — a digital analytics specialist and strategist with over 14 years of experience optimizing customer journeys and driving measurable marketing performance. I've led the full experiment lifecycle — from A/B testing to advanced multivariate analysis — while building dashboards and insights that empower decision-makers.": "你好，我是 Youssef McCarthy，一名数字分析专家与策略顾问，拥有 14 年以上优化客户旅程、驱动可衡量营销表现的经验。我主导过完整的实验生命周期——从 A/B 测试到高级多变量分析——同时构建能让决策者真正用起来的仪表板与洞察。",
      "Experience a dynamic, interactive playground where you control the design paradigm. Watch entire layouts seamlessly morph in real-time across five cutting-edge design systems—from Cyber Neon to Brutalism—showcasing the continuous feedback loop between strategy and design.": "体验一个由你掌控设计范式的互动实验场。看整版布局在五套前沿设计系统之间实时变形——从 Cyber Neon 到 Brutalism——呈现策略与设计之间持续的反馈循环。",
      "Immerse yourself in a fully simulated, highly interactive Looker Studio dashboard. Engage directly with a live multi-channel data stream, manipulate telemetry diagnostics, and explore real-time conversion pathways.": "沉浸式体验一个完全模拟、高度可交互的 Looker Studio 仪表板。直接操作实时多渠道数据流，调整遥测诊断，探索实时转化路径。",
